OL,3,GNEWSAStudents create sign to promote
OL,4,Arecycling message
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents have created new signage for a
OL,7,Frecycling centre using materials
OL,8,Fgathered from beaches, classrooms and
OL,9,Fhomes.
OL,11,FPupils from 17 schools across the
OL,12,Fisland worked to create letters
OL,13,Fspelling "reduce reuse recycle" for La
OL,14,FCollette Household Recycling Centre.
OL,16,FInfrastructure and Environment (I&E)
OL,17,Fsaid the letters on the side of the
OL,18,FJohn Rive building were intended to
OL,19,Freflect the types of waste islanders
OL,20,Fproduce and reiterate the importance of
OL,21,Fresponsible waste management.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
