OL,3,GNEWSAStudents create sign to promote
OL,4,Arecycling message
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach school was responsible for
OL,7,Fdesigning one letter and I&E staff made
OL,8,Fa mosaic for the 18th letter from
OL,9,Fpottery and tiles deposited at the
OL,10,Frecycling centre, project leaders said.
